  "description": "Recently, rumors have been circulating that the nuns are being seduced by the demon. Isabella, who has been living a devout life of faith, has never had difficulty maintaining her chastity until she became a nun, so she considers those who are swayed by the demon’s temptation foolish. However, the demon notices the desire hidden deep inside Isabella. That night, Isabella’s fellow nun Marianne suddenly comes to visit and confesses her feelings and kisses Isabella. Isabella, for some reason, cannot push Marianne away…\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of the 2024 Post Type GL Winter Anthology (\\[GL\\] 2024 포스타입 앤솔로지 | 겨울).*",
